{"book":"esther","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:56:27.945404216Z","verse":8,"ref":"esther 3:8","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":3,"translation":"And Haman said to ⟨the⟩ king Ahasuerus, “There ⟨is⟩ a certain people scattered and dispersed among the peoples in all the provinces of your kingdom. Their laws are different from every people, and ⟨את⟩ the laws of the king they do not do, and it is not profitable to the king to let them rest.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And said"},{"surface":"המן","gloss":"Haman"},{"surface":"למלך","gloss":"to the king"},{"surface":"אחשורוש","gloss":"Ahasuerus"},{"surface":"ישנו","gloss":"There is"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"a people"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"one"},{"surface":"מפזר","gloss":"scattered"},{"surface":"ומפרד","gloss":"and dispersed"},{"surface":"בין","gloss":"among"},{"surface":"העמים","gloss":"the peoples"},{"surface":"בכל","gloss":"in all"},{"surface":"מדינות","gloss":"the provinces"},{"surface":"מלכותך","gloss":"of your kingdom"},{"surface":"ודתיהם","gloss":"and their laws"},{"surface":"שנות","gloss":"differ"},{"surface":"מכל","gloss":"from every"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"people"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the laws of the king"},{"surface":"דתי","gloss":"the laws"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"of the king"},{"surface":"אינם","gloss":"they do not"},{"surface":"עשים","gloss":"do"},{"surface":"ולמלך","gloss":"and to the king"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"it is not"},{"surface":"שוה","gloss":"worthwhile"},{"surface":"להניחם","gloss":"to let them rest"}]}